    ],
    "text": "hospitalized thereafter.",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.100000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      65.43,
      448.75,
      538.61,
      510.37
    ],
    "text": "The accused-appellant had been indicted on the footing that the offence of grave sexual abuse on Harini Lasanga was committed by the accused-appellant between 18.09,2006 and 4th November 2006. In this case no",
    "fonts": [
