    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.100000381469727,
      14.196917533874512,
      14.640972137451172
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      65.45,
      135.55,
      538.39,
      176.3
    ],
    "text": "vagina. When this happened her mother was inside the room. Contrary to the evidence of the victim the mother of the victim denies ever going",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.100000381469727,
      14.165448188781738,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.201335906982422,
      14.312399864196777,
      14.424858093261719,
      14.560287475585938
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      65.96,
      178.04,
      537.71,
      218.54
    ],
    "text": "inside the room and waking the brother. According to her as usual the boy had been brought and given to her. If the mother's evidence is to be",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.337904930114746,
      13.408650398254395,
      13.938019752502441,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.312399864196777,
      14.446785926818848,
      14.47472095489502
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      65.97,
      220.51,
      537.95,
      261.01
    ],
    "text": "believed then the said incident could not have happened the way alleged by the victim of this case. This certainly creates a grave doubt in the",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.878612518310547,
      13.97782039642334,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.153299331665039,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.256828308105469,
      14.560287475585938
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      65.86,
      262.99,
      537.08,
      303.25
    ],
    "text": "prosecution case as to whether the accused-appellant had an opportunity to commit the alleged offence as stated by the victim. It is",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.281599044799805,
      13.337904930114746,
      13.408650398254395,
      13.766199111938477,
      13.976156234741211,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.129718780517578,
      14.151007652282715,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.446785926818848
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      65.47,
      305.24,
      538.55,
      324.62
    ],
    "text": "very unlikely that a person would engage in such a sexual act under the",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.997225761413574,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.346545219421387
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      65.64,
      326.6,
      538.43,
      367.09
    ],
    "text": "given circumstances. The victim has further stated that the son of the accused-appellant too was inside the room at the time. I therefore hold",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.841072082519531,
      14.088345527648926,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.221823692321777,
      14.257817268371582,
      14.2811861038208,
      14.424858093261719
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      65.45,
      369.07,
      537.6,
      409.57
    ],
    "text": "that the story of the victim that grave sexual abuse was committed by the accused-appellant does not satisfy the test of probability.",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.086294174194336,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.215526580810547,
      14.256828308105469,
      14.2811861038208,
      14.560287475585938
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      65.43,
      419.48,
      537.95,
      438.86
    ],
    "text": "The crucial issue that arose for determination by the learned trial Judge",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.07933521270752,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.2811861038208,
      14.3035306930542
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      66.21,
      440.6,
      538.82,
      459.98
    ],
    "text": "in the instant case was whether this girl had been in fact subjected to",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.854055404663086,
      14.05101490020752,
      14.088345527648926,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.119935989379883,
      14.312399864196777
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      65.87,
      461.95,
      538.54,
      481.33
    ],
    "text": "sexual abuse between said period by the accused-appellant as alleged by",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.281599044799805,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.17748737335205
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      65.69,
      483.32,
      539.16,
      502.7
    ],
    "text": "the victim. Medical expert Dr.lndira Kitulwatta has testified to court what",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.841072082519531,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.118388175964355,
      14.57993221282959
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      66.1,
      504.44,
      539.36,
      587.17
    ],
    "text": "she observed when he examined Harini on 07.11.2006. The doctor has observed that there is evidence of repeated vaginal penetration over a period of time. The evidence of the doctor reveals that the victim has been abused over a period of few months. The doctor has observed that",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.337904930114746,
      13.841072082519531,
      13.996369361877441,
      14.00296688079834,
      14.070319175720215,
      14.095749855041504,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.139046669006348,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.19512939453125,
      14.215526580810547,
      14.2811861038208,
      14.346545219421387,
      14.560287475585938,
      14.69446849822998
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      65.69,
      589.16,
      539.11,
      608.54
    ],
    "text": "there is a wasting of the hyman due to repeated vaginal penetration over",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.532635688781738,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.446785926818848,
      14.69446849822998
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 3,
    "bbox": [
      65.94,
      610.27,
      539.39,
      713.65
    ],
    "text": "a period of time. This conclusion has been arrived at by examining the victim and by the abrasions and the wasted nature of the hyman. The evidence indicates abuse over a period of 1 Y2 months. The expert evidence of the doctor who examined the said victim do not support the evidence of the victim as the victim alleged that the accused-appellant",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.55775260925293,
      13.300000190734863,
      13.408650398254395,
      13.922229766845703,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.134608268737793,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.215526580810547,
      14.256828308105469,
      14.257817268371582,
      14.424858093261719,
      14.560287475585938,
      14.69446849822998
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      65.55,
      70.52,
      539.23,
      111.02
    ],
    "text": "committed the act of grave sexual abuse only on a single occasion. Considering all these matters I hold that the medical evidence does not",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.095749855041504,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.174653053283691,
      14.411606788635254,
      14.424858093261719
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      65.61,
      112.99,
      537.33,
      153.26
    ],
    "text": "support the evidence of the victim that she was subjected to grave sexual abuse by the accused-appellant.",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.070319175720215,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.257817268371582,
      14.312399864196777,
      14.346545219421387,
      14.560287475585938
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      66.11,
      163.4,
      521.36,
      182.78
    ],
    "text": "In Premasiri V. The Queen 77 N.L.R 86, Court of Criminal Appeal held:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.541905403137207,
      13.829352378845215,
      13.84234619140625,
      14.02756404876709,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.424858093261719
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      65.21,
      192.91,
      537.78,
      254.29
    ],
    "text": "\"on the uncorroborated evidence of the complainant only when such evidence is of such character as to convince the jury that she is speaking the truth.\"",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.408650398254395,
      13.532635688781738,
      14.057987213134766,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.232378959655762,
      14.346545219421387,
      14.39663028717041,
      14.446785926818848,
      14.560287475585938
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      66.11,
      264.44,
      537.21,
      304.93
    ],
    "text": "In Sunil and another V. The Attorney General 1986 {1} SLR 230, it was held that:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.92068099975586,
      13.403024673461914,
      13.829352378845215,
      14.088345527648926,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.101700782775879,
      14.122632026672363,
      14.359707832336426
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      65.84,
      315.08,
      538.14,
      376.7
    ],
    "text": "IICorroboration is only required or afforded if the witness reqUiring corroboration is otherwise credible. If the evidence of the witness requiring corroboration is not credible his testimony should be rejected",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.140289306640625,
      13.337904930114746,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.174653053283691,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.239212989807129,
      14.424858093261719,
      14.47472095489502,
      14.81568717956543
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      65.86,
      378.67,
      539.37,
      398.05
    ],
    "text": "and the accused-appellant acquitted. Seeking corroboration of a",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.100000381469727,
      14.560287475585938
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      65.75,
      400.04,
      537.64,
      419.42
    ],
    "text": "witness's evidence should not be used as a process of inducing belief in",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.281599044799805,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.174653053283691,
      14.69446849822998
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      65.88,
      421.16,
      401.15,
      440.54
    ],
    "text": "such evidence where such evidence is not credible.",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.532635688781738,
      14.057987213134766,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.174653053283691
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      65.95,
      450.67,
      538.19,
      490.93
    ],
    "text": "It is very dangerous to act on the uncorroborated testimony of a woman victim of a sex offence but if her evidence is convincing such evidence",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.337904930114746,
      13.532635688781738,
      13.928102493286133,
      14.095749855041504,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.13226318359375,
      14.424858093261719,
      14.446785926818848,
      14.69446849822998,
      14.81568717956543
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      66.32,
      492.91,
      441.67,
      512.29
    ],
    "text": "could be acted on even in the absence of corroboration.\"",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.938019752502441,
      14.05101490020752,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.560287475585938
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      65.93,
      522.19,
      538.51,
      604.93
    ],
    "text": "In this case there is a serious doubt as to whether the incident has taken place in the way as described by the victim in court. The medical evidence too was not supportive of the sexual act having taken place in the manner testified by the victim.",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.281599044799805,
      13.337904930114746,
      13.408650398254395,
      13.829352378845215,
      13.841072082519531,
      13.976156234741211,
      14.05101490020752,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.119935989379883,
      14.153299331665039,
      14.174653053283691,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.417084693908691,
      14.446785926818848,
      14.560287475585938
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      66.15,
      614.83,
      538.19,
      655.33
    ],
    "text": "The function of an appellate court in dealing with a judgment mainly on the facts from court which saw and heard witnesses has been specified",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.766199111938477,
      13.922229766845703,
      14.05101490020752,
      14.07933521270752,
      14.095749855041504,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.116690635681152,
      14.133909225463867,
      14.160271644592285,
      14.560287475585938
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      66.59,
      656.51,
      538.48,
      676.3
    ],
    "text": "as follows by Macdonnel c.J in the King V. Guneratne 14 Ceylon Law",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica",
      "Times-Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.281599044799805,
      13.350056648254395,
      13.831424713134766,
      13.980947494506836,
      14.05101490020752,
      14.09939956665039,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.17748737335205
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 4,
    "bbox": [
      67.11,
      677.72,
      163.02,
      697.1
    ],
    "text": "Recorder 174:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.100000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      66.69,
      71.95,
      538.1,
      112.45
    ],
    "text": "\"I have to apply these tests as they seem to be, which a court of appeal must apply to an appeal coming to it on questions of fact:",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      13.408650398254395,
      13.997577667236328,
      14.100000381469727,
      14.13814926147461,
      14.312399864196777,
      14.359707832336426,
      14.424858093261719,
      14.446785926818848,
      14.560287475585938
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      84.61,
      122.6,
      540.13,
      141.98
    ],
    "text": "{1}Was the verdict of the judge unreasonably against the weight of",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.100000381469727,
      14.17748737335205,
      14.288095474243164,
      14.560287475585938
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
      101.93,
      143.48,
      192.62,
      162.86
    ],
    "text": "the evidence.",
    "fonts": [
      "Helvetica"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      14.100000381469727
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 5,
    "bbox": [
